urce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451950/extras/289fdcb0cecf20a6f8b814622f0d07f7.mp4?t=1784181300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 SIX WARSHIPS, SIX PLAYSTYLES</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451950/extras/bdc95547cb914b8a05575f4531ea783c.avif?t=1784181300\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451950/extras_big/bdc95547cb914b8a05575f4531ea783c.webp?t=1784181300 width=1560 height=274 /></span><br><br>Every hull changes how the game plays — and each one is earned, not bought:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Standard Fighter</strong> — the reliable all-rounder.<br></li><li><strong>Combat Tech</strong> — twin blasters and +15% fire speed.<br></li><li><strong>Tank Battleship</strong> — slow, massive, shrugs off half of all damage.<br></li><li><strong>Alien Saucer</strong> — burns entire crowds with a continuous Burning Beam.<br></li><li><strong>Bomber Starship</strong> — an automatic bomb launcher and bigger explosions.<br></li><li><strong>Collider</strong> — no guns. Charge up, ram through the swarm, detonate shockwaves.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451950/extras/43001bcdfa1c2455c1c0ccb39ca4a90e.poster.avif?t=1784181300\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451950/extras/43001bcdfa1c2455c1c0ccb39ca4a90e.webm?t=1784181300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451950/extras/43001bcdfa1c2455c1c0ccb39ca4a90e.mp4?t=1784181300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔫 BUILD GAME-BREAKING LOADOUTS</h2>17 weapons and 15 passives, all upgradeable mid-run: kineti